roughly equivalent to {zo'e ne sumti}.

http://dag.github.com/cll/18/11/ details how it's grammatical without being
very precise about the semantics, but I've been saying this in IRC for
quite some time, after having learned about it from selpa'i. Unfortunately,
it seems like no one else knows about it, so I make a point of saying it to
spread it :)

